291
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:22,655
The cutie wagon is closing in quickly.

292
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:24,777
These are the final moments of round one's

293
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:28,297
donut race who will win

294
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:33,097
i told you these lame

295
00:13:33,180 --> 00:13:36,737
tricks won't work she even sees through

296
00:13:36,820 --> 00:13:40,637
operation fake gold
formidable truly formidable

297
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:44,357
and now i have a question for her what is

298
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:47,797
it like to go through
life so dated piss off

299
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:53,417
it's too late for her her heart is cold she
has no soul But the real goal is nearby.

300
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:54,676
We're getting close.

301
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:56,757
I'm not using that dial again.

302
