The purity of your heart is astounding.

309
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,817
Pay attention, Portia.

310
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,076
You've been tricked.

311
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,984
Those guys are complete idiots.

312
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:16,828
I'd die of embarrassment
if we lost to them.

313
