The barrel tiger is finally
approaching the long bamboo cape.

319
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:32,760
The goal is just beyond it.

320
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:34,508
They're in the homestretch.

321
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:36,177
Hey, he's right.

322
00:14:36,260 --> 00:14:38,440
I can see the finish line. Wait up!

323
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:40,837
But they're catching up to us.

324
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,567
There's no way we'll
beat them at this speed.

325
