I've got an idea.

326
00:14:44,780 --> 00:14:46,357
Usak, can you shoot down that bamboo?

327
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,080
Bamboo? All right.

328
00:14:50,660 --> 00:14:51,490
Like that?

329
00:14:51,620 --> 00:14:55,460
Yes, more, more! Monja! Capote!
Move it! Full speed ahead!

330
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:59,800
We'll ram them and sink that stupid
boat to the bottom of the ocean!

331
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,320
Whoa! Bingo!

332
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:06,410
Oh, no!

333
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:08,089
Capote, you say something!

334
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:09,417
I've had it!

335
